[00:00.000] 作词 : yulia yulia yulia
[00:00.063] 作曲 : yulia yulia yulia
[00:00.127](Intro: lennox murei & cocoa)
[00:01.537]Oh, sweet darling
[00:03.763]It's so hard to cope with you not here
[00:06.718]I need to go, it's hard to exist
[00:10.484]Please know I can't live—
[00:13.836]
[00:14.028](Verse 1: lennox murei, lennox murei & cocoa)
[00:14.260]One more day you go unfound
[00:16.152]It's the first time you're not around
[00:18.633]When the lights go out, I'll be waiting
[00:24.347]For you, back at my old town
[00:26.614]I beg for nights to hear the sound
[00:29.280]Of your voice keeping me sane, and so—
[00:34.832]
[00:35.056](Chorus: lennox murei & cocoa)
[00:35.298]I talk to myself when I'm driving
[00:42.988]You're still in the passenger seat
[00:45.666]The ghost of you's still thriving
[00:52.284]So alive but incomplete
[00:56.251]So when I get home
[01:00.244]Will you reside in my arms and fall asleep?
[01:06.590]Or will I wake up to your alarm
[01:13.788]Ringing out of reach?
[01:17.344]
[01:28.083](Verse 2: lennox murei & cocoa, lennox murei)
[01:28.543]I still see your face each time I play our little song
[01:37.687]So I'll stay in the same place
[01:43.269]And maybe time will fade the pain you left behind
[01:51.311]Your missing smile keeps me awake
[01:56.178]It feeds the ache
[01:58.201]And I don't know quite where to go when you're not here
[02:06.781]So I'll just wait for you, my dear
[02:11.179]
[02:11.456](Instrumental Break)
[02:29.540]
[02:32.456](Bridge: lennox murei & cocoa)
[02:32.704]I walk past the spots we knew, the diner lights still shine for two
[02:37.285]But I won't make my plate 'til I'm with you
[02:43.495]At least for one more night, I don't know what the hell's in sight
[02:47.897]For me, once I've completely lost my mind
[02:55.096]From all this time we've spent apart
[03:00.203]My darling, please just come back home
[03:05.877]I'll wait alone
[03:08.622]'Til your heartbeat and mine can reunite so—
[03:14.666]
[03:16.388](Refrain: lennox murei & cocoa)
[03:16.660]Why is it so hard to find our love
[03:22.753]If it's how we first met?
[03:27.067]I talk to myself when I'm driving
[03:34.979]You're still in the passenger seat
[03:37.583]
[03:37.876](Chorus: lennox murei & cocoa, lennox murei)
[03:38.045]I talk to myself when I'm driving
[03:45.516]You're still in the passenger seat
[03:48.251]The ghost of you's still thriving
[03:54.834]So alive but incomplete
[03:58.557]So when I get home
[04:02.874]Will you reside in my arms and fall asleep?
[04:09.266]Or will I wake up to your alarm
[04:16.095]Ringing out of reach?
[04:19.929]
[04:33.708](Outro: lennox murei & cocoa)
[04:37.794]I light a smoke and think of you
[04:43.256]Oh, the way you smiled
[04:47.460]The things we knew
[04:50.922]But maybe love's just passing through
